{"step_index":1587,"source":"SYSTEM","type":"SYSTEM_MESSAGE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T21:53:43Z","content":"The following is a <SYSTEM_MESSAGE> not actually sent by the user. It is provided by the system as important information to pay attention to.\n\n<SYSTEM_MESSAGE>\n[Message] timestamp=2026-08-21T21:53:42Z sender=eaa457bc-8321-40fa-ae7a-46998891643f priority=MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH content=# Comprehensive Visual & UI Layer Research Report: Spectra\n\nThis report provides an in-depth breakdown of the visual and user interface layer of **Spectra** (`c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web`), including view structure, CSS styles, JavaScript interactions, color palette, typography, and specific visual patterns that appear artificial, overly generic, or AI-generated.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Inventory of UI Views & Sections\n\nThe application is structured into three main full-page stages (`.view`), managed dynamically via CSS class `.active`:\n\n### Stage 1: Onboarding View (`#onboarding-view`)\n- **Brand Header & Hero**:\n  - `SPECTRA` logo with extreme letter-spacing (`0.22em`, 26px uppercase, 800 weight) and sub-tagline `\"AI Interview Coach\"` (`web/index.html#L27-L30`).\n  - Subtitle: *\"Set up your profile, AI preferences, and API credentials.\"*\n- **Tab Navigation Bar (`.tabs-nav`)**:\n  - 4 pill-style tabs: `1. Your Profile`, `2. AI Setup`, `3. Advanced Config`, `4. Commands & Tips`.\n- **Tab 1: Your Profile (`#profile-tab`)**:\n  - **Quick Presets Grid** (`.interview-presets-section`, `web/index.html#L45-L75`): 3 cards (\"Live Coding & DSA\", \"System Design\", \"Behavioral & HR\") featuring emoji icons (`⚡`, `🏗️`, `💬`) and pill badges (\"Ultra-Fast\", \"Architecture\", \"STAR Method\").\n  - **Candidate Profile Fieldset**: Inputs for `Name`, `Company`, `Target Role`, `Resume Textarea`, and a `\"📄 Upload PDF\"` file upload button + status text. Includes an inline `\"⚡ Demo\"` button in the fieldset legend (`web/index.html#L79-L80`).\n  - **Interview Focus Fieldset**: Checkbox grid (`Behavioral`, `System Design`, `DSA`, `Coding`, `Cultural Fit`, `HR / Screening`) and a highlighted standalone card checkbox for `💬 Brief & Human` (\"S\n<truncated 12658 bytes>\nist in `:root`! They are leftovers from multiple disparate template generations.\n3. **Buzzword-Dense Card Copy**:\n   - Card badges: `\"Ultra-Fast\"`, `\"Architecture\"`, `\"STAR Method\"`.\n   - Pro tips: `\"🥷 Stealth Professional Tip\"`, `\"📸 Multi-Screenshot Analysis\"`, `\"⚡ Speed Strategy\"`.\n   - Checkbox label: `\"💬 Brief & Human: Senior-level answers in one natural paragraph\"`.\n4. **Injected `<style>` Blocks Everywhere in JavaScript**:\n   - `web/js/live-interview.js` injects 3 separate `<style>` tags at runtime (`resume-scroll-styles`, `vision-analysis-styles`, `streaming-response-styles`).\n   - `web/js/preset-manager.js` injects `preset-manager-styles`.\n   - `web/js/screenshot-service.js` injects `screenshot-service-styles`.\n   - This creates CSS specificity battles and overrides that bypass the main stylesheets.\n\n---\n\n## Summary Findings Table\n\n| Issue Area | Severity | File Locations | Primary Observation |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Brand Identity** | Medium | `index.html:7, 28, 332`, `main.js:332`, `hotkeys.js:1` | Mixed naming between `Aura` and `SPECTRA`. |\n| **Glows & Gradients** | High | `main.css:1039`, `live-interview.js:579`, `preset-manager.js:106` | Saturated glowing green CTA buttons, purple gradients, and neon cyan selections. |\n| **Emoji Pollution** | High | `index.html:47-311`, `live-interview.js:508`, `screenshot-service.js:213` | Over 30+ emoji icons used as bullet points, headers, card icons, and toast badges. |\n| **Excessive Animations** | Medium | `live-interview.css:101, 669`, `markdown-styles.css:358`, `live-interview.js:227` | Constant pulsing dots, blinking cursors on completed items, and 20ms staggered list reveals. |\n| **Injected Stylesheets** | High | `live-interview.js`, `preset-manager.js`, `screenshot-service.js` | 5+ runtime `<style>` injections containing duplicated styles and hardcoded hex colors. |\n| **Broken CSS Tokens** | Low | `main.css:690, 724, 1332, 1386` | Undefined variables like `--subtle-purple` and `--accent-indigo` used across rules. |\n\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>","truncated_fields":["content"]}
